> [Health] authorities in New Zealand said that about 200 passengers on the Dawn Princess ship became infected with the norovirus.
The ship was scheduled to leave[ for Australia on Monday]. The last[ time there] was a[ nor]ovirus outbreak[ on the] ship[ was back] in[ 2012].
