> [ATS] Page[Speed] is an open-source Page[Speed] optimization plugin for the ATS proxy server.
Apache Traffic Server (ATS) is a fast, scalable and extensible HTTP caching proxy server. Formerly a[ commercial] product, Yahoo! donated it to the Apache Foundation, and it is[ now] an Apache TLP. Google PageSpeed tools analyze and[ optimize] a[ website]'s performance following web[ best] practices.
We-Amp created a open-source web server module which automatically applies the Page[Speed] best practises to a[ website served] by Apache Traffic Server.
More information available on www.[ats]pagespeed.com.


